    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Universal device connection</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>The converter box connects to a mobile input device, converting the signal and transmitting it along a cable to the SPI3. This allows the video to be routed and recorded. With a wall plate connection, mobile devices can be routed and displayed without needing additional monitors.&nbsp;<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
